Recommends: evtest, lm-sensors
Suggests: git, clang, linux-headers-generic
Description: Div Acer Manager Max for Acer laptops
 Replicates and extends Acer NitroSense / PredatorSense on Linux:
 performance profiles, fan control, battery charge limiting and calibration,
 keyboard backlight control, LCD override and live hardware telemetry.
 .
 The graphical interface talks to the DAMX daemon over a local Unix socket.
 The Linuwu-Sense kernel drivers are installed separately with
 "sudo damx-setup --drivers" (or the standalone DAMX installer).
